{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>and multiply</b> — four times in the Masorah, and the others: ורבה העזובה, ורבה משטמה, ורבה היא על האדם. And this is what is in the Midrash: 'Would you even think that they would fear the beasts of the field? But it is written: \"For you have a covenant with the stones of the field,\" etc. Rather, it is revealed and known before Him that they are destined to sin, and they will be abandoned to the beasts — and this is: \"There is one that spoileth,\" etc. — ורבה היא על האדם. What is it? ורבה משטמה.' End quote. ורבה העזובה — 'in the midst of the land,' that the land will be abandoned by them; ורבה עליך חית השדה — 'and the beasts of the field shall multiply against you.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:13.736266891Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}